{"candidateAnswer":"7 August 2023","evidence":"[D29:1 | 8:06 pm on 9 August, 2023] Maria: Hey John, what's been going on? I just wanted to check in. Last week was wild - I volunteered at the homeless shelter and they gave me a medal! It was humbling and I'm really glad I could help.","itemId":"urn:uuid:12ec54c9-7aa2-55f7-8d8a-d7b055a97f24","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:fff8a4d2b80092e31f1e223e7d3142fda02a2bee3c64bd6549e0b54bc4ed31f3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Maria receive a medal from the homeless shelter?","referenceAnswer":"The week before 9 August 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"fff8a4d2b80092e31f1e223e7d3142fda02a2bee3c64bd6549e0b54bc4ed31f3"}}]}